    <!-- ====================================================== -->
    <string name="experimental_notice_title">Switchly 2.2.1 feedback</string>
    <string name="experimental_notice_body">This build includes the 2.2.1 beta cleanup and release-candidate changes.\n\nThe app structure changed: Rules now contains profile-based app, website/domain, in-app and schedule rules. Activity contains usage, app launches, screen unlocks, history and blocked notifications. NFC, QR, barcodes and paired tags moved to Settings → Keys &amp; codes.\n\nPlease send feedback or a support report if something feels off around:\n• the new Rules / Activity / Settings navigation\n• profile-based website/domain rules and migrated domains\n• profile-based in-app rules and Block selected / Allow selected modes\n• YouTube, Instagram, X or Snapchat in-app blocking\n• schedules, backup/restore, Premium or billing status\n• Home customization, widgets, tiles and statistics\n\nIn-app blocking is still experimental because social apps can change their UI at any time. Small UI issues, unclear wording and edge cases are useful too.</string>

